WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:09.634
I never touched 
an award, an Oscar.

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:12.178
So this is the first time
touching an Oscar.

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:13.638
It's ripping my Band-Aid off.

00:00:13.638 --> 00:00:14.973
You know what I mean?

00:00:15.056 --> 00:00:15.932
This is amazing.

00:00:15.932 --> 00:00:18.184
I didn't realize how heavy
this would be.

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:20.895
Reminds me of holding my baby
daughter, it has a similar feeling

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:23.231
Well my daughter has grown up,

00:00:23.231 --> 00:00:25.650
And she saw me, 
as her father,

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:27.527
Always being busy 
performing on stage

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:28.528
in all these various theaters.

00:00:29.154 --> 00:00:31.990
And she was trying to understand
what her father was doing.

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:33.491
But I think finally, now

00:00:33.491 --> 00:00:36.036
she's able to witness this
and come along on my journey

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:38.329
and come along on this
wild ride with me.

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:40.749
So now she sees her
father's success

00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:42.667
from really from scratch.

00:00:42.667 --> 00:00:44.961
And I think my daughter
finally feels proud of her dad.

00:00:44.961 --> 00:00:46.504
She's a CODA in real life,

00:00:46.504 --> 00:00:48.465
a child of a deaf adult,
she has two deaf parents.

00:00:48.465 --> 00:00:49.215
You know what I mean?

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.968
It's really cool and it's 
such a special moment.

